{"annotationScore": 5.0, "comments": [{"commentType": "FUNCTION", "texts": [{"evidences": [{"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000250"}], "value": "Transcriptional activator that directly regulates early activation of the myogenic determination gene MYF5 by binding in a sequence-specific manner to the early epaxial enhancer element of it. Involved in somitogenesis during embryogenesis and somite development and differentiation into sclerotome and dermomyotome. Required for the initiation and/or maintenance of proper organization of the sclerotome, dermomyotome and myotome (By similarity)"}]}, {"commentType": "SUBUNIT", "texts": [{"evidences": [{"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000250"}], "value": "Homodimer"}]}, {"commentType": "INTERACTION", "interactions": [{"interactantOne": {"intActId": "EBI-18072054", "uniProtKBAccession": "Q9Y5R5"}, "interactantTwo": {"geneName": "MAGED1", "intActId": "EBI-716006", "uniProtKBAccession": "Q9Y5V3"}, "numberOfExperiments": 3, "organismDiffer": false}, {"interactantOne": {"intActId": "EBI-18072054", "uniProtKBAccession": "Q9Y5R5"}, "interactantTwo": {"geneName": "TLE5", "intActId": "EBI-11741437", "uniProtKBAccession": "Q08117-2"}, "numberOfExperiments": 3, "organismDiffer": false}]}, {"commentType": "SUBCELLULAR LOCATION", "subcellularLocations": [{"location": {"evidences": [{"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000255", "id": "PRU00070", "source": "PROSITE-ProRule"}], "id": "SL-0191", "value": "Nucleus"}}]}, {"commentType": "ALTERNATIVE PRODUCTS", "events": ["Alternative splicing"], "isoforms": [{"isoformIds": ["Q9Y5R5-1"], "isoformSequenceStatus": "Displayed", "name": {"value": "1"}}, {"isoformIds": ["Q9Y5R5-2"], "isoformSequenceStatus": "Described", "name": {"value": "2"}, "sequenceIds": ["VSP_041248", "VSP_041249"]}, {"isoformIds": ["Q9Y5R5-3"], "isoformSequenceStatus": "Described", "name": {"value": "3"}, "sequenceIds": ["VSP_041247"]}]}, {"commentType": "TISSUE SPECIFICITY", "texts": [{"value": "Expressed in testis, kidney and skeletal muscle"}]}, {"commentType": "DISEASE", "disease": {"acronym": "SCDO7", "description": "A form of spondylocostal dysostosis, a condition of variable severity associated with vertebral and rib segmentation defects. The main skeletal malformations include fusion of vertebrae, hemivertebrae, fusion of certain ribs, and other rib malformations. Deformity of the chest and spine (severe scoliosis, kyphoscoliosis and lordosis) is a natural consequence of the malformation and leads to a dwarf-like appearance. As the thorax is small, infants frequently have respiratory insufficiency and repeated respiratory infections resulting in life-threatening complications in the first year of life. SCDO7 patients exhibit facial dysmorphisms, including cleft palate, and hypoplastic or absent thymus with immunodeficiency.", "diseaseAccession": "DI-07153", "diseaseCrossReference": {"database": "MIM", "id": "621523"}, "diseaseId": "Spondylocostal dysostosis 7, autosomal recessive", "evidences": [{"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "id": "29681102", "source": "PubMed"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "id": "41014130", "source": "PubMed"}]}, "note": {"texts": [{"value": "The disease is caused by variants affecting the gene represented in this entry"}]}}, {"commentType": "MISCELLANEOUS", "molecule": "Isoform 2", "texts": [{"evidences": [{"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000305"}], "value": "Produced by DMRT2 bicistronic transcripts (AF284223/AF284224) from non-overlapping reading frame, according to PubMed:10729224"}]}, {"commentType": "MISCELLANEOUS", "molecule": "Isoform 3", "texts": [{"evidences": [{"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000305"}], "value": "Produced by DMRT2 bicistronic transcripts (AF284223/AF284224) from non-overlapping reading frame, according to PubMed:10729224"}]}, {"commentType": "SIMILARITY", "texts": [{"evidences": [{"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000305"}], "value": "Belongs to the DMRT family"}]}], "entryAudit": {"entryVersion": 186, "firstPublicDate": "2000-12-01", "lastAnnotationUpdateDate": "2026-11-04", "lastSequenceUpdateD